1
00:00:57,068 --> 00:01:01,489
In five hundred years, I have never forgotten that gaze

2
00:01:02,251 --> 00:01:04,817
When she cast the Curse of Immortality

3
00:01:05,426 --> 00:01:08,498
I saw neither pity nor pleasure

4
00:01:08,750 --> 00:01:11,530
In the Ruler of Death's eyes

5
00:01:12,419 --> 00:01:16,003
All around, the people begged for mercy

6
00:01:16,003 --> 00:01:20,592
And she looked on without the faintest flicker of emotion

7
00:01:32,102 --> 00:01:34,378
Now, look at me!

8
00:01:34,790 --> 00:01:37,990
Ronova, face your enemy

9
00:01:38,250 --> 00:01:42,666
And feel the full force of the living!

10
00:01:50,794 --> 00:01:51,351
Get back!

